{"step_index":10326,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T14:34:10Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-25T17:34:10+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-25T17:34:11+03:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n=== STEP 9533 ===\r\n<USER_REQUEST>\r\nفي مشكلة ومبعتش صورة والبرومبت مش عارف ولا اصلا انت عاوز كدا ؟؟\r\n\r\n<div _ngcontent-ng-c1480764559=\"\" class=\"chat-view-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><ms-chat-session _ngcontent-ng-c1480764559=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2680143636=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><ms-autoscroll-container _ngcontent-ng-c2680143636=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"hide-scrollbar\" _nghost-ng-c4246658289=\"\" style=\"--ms-autoscroll-container-scrolled: 1;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4246658289=\"\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2680143636=\"\" class=\"chat-session-content\"><!----><ms-chat-turn _ngcontent-ng-c2680143636=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1083380779=\"\" id=\"turn-9CF7E204-4C3C-48C3-9CE0-A43B32E2A597\" class=\"text-chunk-host ng-star-inserted\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1083380779=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" cdkmonitorsubtreefocus=\"\" class=\"chat-turn-container code-block-aligner render user ng-star-inserted\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1083380779=\"\" class=\"actions-container\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1083380779=\"\" class=\"actions hover-or-edit\"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1083380779=\"\" ms-button=\"\" variant=\"icon-borderless\" mattooltipposition=\"below\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger toggle-edit-button ms-button-borderless ms-button-icon ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Edit\" jslog=\"228330;track:generic_click,impression;mutable:true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1083380779=\"\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined notranslate ms-button-icon-symbol ng-star-inserted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1083380779=\"\" ms-button=\"\" variant=\"icon-borderless\" name=\"rerun-button\" mattooltipposition=\"below\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger rerun-button ms-button-borderless ms-button-icon ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Rerun this turn\" jslog=\"228331;track:generic_click,impression\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><svg _ngcontent-ng-c1083380779=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\n<truncated 2726 bytes>\nي هذه الصورة...\"*.\r\n   * ولأنه **لم يجد أي صورة مرفقة في الشات أصلاً**، Gemini افترض أنك تطلب منه \"مثالاً تجريبياً\"، فقام باختراع أدوية من خياله (أدوية سورية وشركات افتراضية: *ش جلفار، ش ابن زهر، ش اوغاريت، ش رامي...*)!\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### الدليل القاطع على الفرق (بين اليدوي والآلي):\r\n\r\n* **في التجربة اليدوية** (التي قمت بها بنفسك ورفعت فيها الصورة في شات المكرومي):\r\n  * رأينا في الـ DOM أن Gemini استخرج **146 صنفاً حقيقياً بنسبة دقة 100%** (*ايراستابكس، ايفيو سبان، بوسكوبان، بروكاسوفت...*).\r\n* **في التجربة الآلية عبر الـ Gateway الحالي:**\r\n  * لم ترتفع الصورة، فجاء الرد عبارة عن هلوسة افتراضية.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### كيف نخطط لحل هذه النقطة؟ (بناءً على طلبك أن نخطط سوياً قبل أي تعديل):\r\n\r\nأمامنا حلّان رئيسيان لجعل الاستخراج عبر Gemini Vision يعمل بشكل آلي:\r\n\r\n#### الحل الأول: تحديث الـ Gateway المحلي (`MSEMAX-GAIStudio`) ليدعم الصور\r\n* نعدل في كود `MSEMAX-GAIStudio\\app.py`:\r\n  1. استقبال كائنات الصور `image_url` وحفظ الصورة مؤقتاً على الجهاز.\r\n  2. إضافة كود في Playwright لرفع ملف الصورة في Google AI Studio (عبر استهداف زر الإرفاق `(+)` أو `input[type=\"file\"]`) والانتظار حتى تظهر الصورة المصغرة في المربع.\r\n  3. كتابة البرومبت وإرساله والتقاط رد الـ JSON كما نفعل في المطابقات.\r\n* **الميزة:** تستمر في العمل عبر شاشة المتصفح المفتوحة أمامك\r\n==================================================\r\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":10327,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T14:34:12Z","thinking":"The local gateway is designed for text matching and discards image data. The previous request was ignored because of this architecture. Further investigation is needed to determine the appropriate handling.\n\n\nA dedicated \"vision\" branch has been created to isolate image processing experiments. The existing `app.py` has been adapted for this new branch. The next step involves testing the image endpoint.\n\nThe observed behavior of the image-based input through the web gateway requires the system to calculate the input's tokens prior to execution. This process likely introduces a delay that needs to be accounted for.\n\n\nInitial hypothesis was that a hook needs to be implemented to trigger image processing. Manual execution confirms the vision endpoint functions, validating the image handling approach. A refined image processing pipeline is proposed, involving PDF splitting, high-quality image extraction, and sending requests for each image with relevant contextual information.\n\n\nThe \"vision\" project copy retained the old, incorrect directory setting, preventing the desktop application from connecting to the new image-aware server. The hidden UI element further obfuscated the incorrect configuration from the user. Consequently, the application was using the legacy server instance, explaining the observed behavior of text-only prompt injection without image attachment.\n\nI'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe observed UI inconsistencies and lack of user-configurable directory settings require further investigation into the application's configuration and user interface elements. The prompt used in the successful test needs comparison with the previously defined structure to identify potential discrepancies and inform updates. Investigating the successful test case's exact output will reveal if the prompt or other factors led to the positive user feedback.\n\n\nThe user's comment indicates a concern that the system might be using an outdated prompt with a previously defined structure. Image 2 reveals the prompt injected by the legacy server. It's necessary to compare the structure of this outdated prompt with the defined structure and expected output to pinpoint discrepancies.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Search for structure details in transcript\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import json\\n\\nwith open(r'C:\\\\Users\\\\kakak\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\\\.system_generated\\\\logs\\\\transcript_full.jsonl', 'r'